IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `re42-nouns`
IMPORT `re42-published-figures`
IMPORT `re42-s9-purchase-tax`
IMPORT `re42-s15-advance`

-- Row il-42, THE BUYER'S SEAT. An individual who buys a dwelling asks two things: how much purchase tax, and whether to send an advance on the seller's tax and how much.
-- These are one-line wrappers around the rule modules, so that a service deploys questions rather than internals. They have no assertions of their own: the functions they call are tested in
-- re42-tests-s9.l4 and re42-tests-s15.l4. The answer to the first is a MAYBE NUMBER: NOTHING means "no figure is held for this day", never an estimate.
-- THE READING of the end of the temporary rule (ג1ו) is an input, because the sources disagree (fork T1 in NOTES.md): the printed Law ends it on 31 December 2024, and a note in the consolidation says it was extended.
-- DRAFT: no domain expert has read this against the source.

§ `The buyer's seat`

@export How much purchase tax do I owe on this purchase of a dwelling? NOTHING means the sources held here give no figure for the day of the purchase.
GIVEN p IS A `A purchase of a dwelling`
      reading IS A `A reading of the end of the (ג1ו) period`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`How much purchase tax do I owe on this purchase` MEANS `the purchase tax on your purchase, on a reading` p reading

@export Where were the amounts behind that purchase tax read: from the official page, or from the consolidation only? NOTHING means no figure is held for the day.
GIVEN p IS A `A purchase of a dwelling`
      reading IS A `A reading of the end of the (ג1ו) period`
GIVETH A MAYBE `Where a figure was read`
`Where were the amounts behind my purchase tax read` MEANS `where the amounts behind your tax were read, on a reading` p reading

@export How much must I transfer to the Director, in all, as an advance on the seller's tax, when I buy a right in land?
GIVEN a IS A `A sale as you, the buyer, see it`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`How much advance must I transfer to the Director in all` MEANS `the advance you must transfer to the Director in all` a

@export How much must I transfer out of this payment to the seller, on account of the advance?
GIVEN a IS A `A sale as you, the buyer, see it`
      paidBefore IS A NUMBER
      thisPayment IS A NUMBER
      transferredSoFar IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`How much of this payment must I transfer to the Director` MEANS `the amount you transfer out of this payment` a paidBefore thisPayment transferredSoFar
